OL,3,GNEWSAMammogram unit's move 'more
OL,4,Adignified' for women
OL,5,
OL,6,FA mobile breast screening unit in
OL,7,FWiltshire is set to be moved following
OL,8,Fa campaign by local women for the
OL,9,Flocation to feel more "dignified".
OL,11,FFor 14 years, the NHS mobile breast
OL,12,Fscreening unit has parked up for its
OL,13,Fstint in Marlborough at the back of the
OL,14,FSavernake Hospital, next to the bins
OL,15,Fand delivery entrance.
OL,17,F"It was not very dignified, and women
OL,18,Fwere stressed when they got there,"
OL,19,Fsaid Annabel McNally, one of several
OL,20,Fwomen who have campaigned for the
OL,21,Fchange.
OL,23,APub: 26-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
