OL,3,GNEWSAMammogram unit's move 'more
OL,4,Adignified' for women
OL,5,
OL,6,FFrom December, the unit will be parked
OL,7,Fat Marlborough Leisure Centre. Dr
OL,8,FGeorgina Angel, screening and
OL,9,Fimmunisation lead, said: "We hope the
OL,10,Fmove will enable more women to attend
OL,11,Ftheir screening."
